port multimedia/gstreamer1-plugins-rust
type port
reason "DragonFly: enable the gtk4 plugin's waylandegl feature only when GTK has Wayland (dragonfly/@<line>/patch-meson.build)"

# meson.build turns on the gtk4 plugin's waylandegl feature (gdk4-wayland)
# whenever GStreamer GL lists a wayland winsys. x11-toolkits/gtk40 is built
# without WAYLAND here, so gdk4-wayland-sys's build script fails on the
# missing gtk4-wayland pkg-config module. The patch also checks for
# gtk4-wayland.pc, so the feature comes back by itself if gtk40 gains it.
